{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["And these are the generations of Yitzhak — by the plain sense of Scripture, Abraham begot Yitzhak, since above it said of Yishmael: בן אברהם אשר ילדה הגר המצרית. But here Yitzhak was Abraham's principal son, for he begot Yitzhak from his full wife, as it is written: כי ביצחק יקרא לך זרע. And so in Chronicles, after writing that Abraham's sons were Yitzhak and Yishmael and the sons of Keturah, it goes back and writes without qualification: ויולד אברהם את יצחק."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:09.280857558Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}